	}
	mes "[Moonho Ahn]";
	mes "I still remember that";
	mes "last legendary match with";
	mes "Dalho Kwak. Now that man was";
	mes "a worthy opponent: he could";
	mes "read others' hands three times";
	mes "faster than the normal eye!";
